pytest-trio
===========

.. image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/chat-join%20now-blue.svg
   :target: https://gitter.im/python-trio/general
   :alt: Join chatroom

.. image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/docs-read%20now-blue.svg
